WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Chronos Policy: Learning Robot Policies on Physical Time. Real robots, Blender, and MuJoCo.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.400
Inference latency. Computation delays the action.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.700
Zoom into Dynamic Cup.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:15.283
Policy sensitive to inference latency. DP and Chronos Policy, 2× playback.

00:00:15.283 --> 00:00:16.533
Zoom back to the inference latency diagram.

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:16.883
Continue on physical time.

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:20.283
Observation timing. Measurements may delay.

00:00:20.283 --> 00:00:21.583
Zoom into Peg Insertion.

00:00:21.583 --> 00:00:26.850
Policy sensitive to observation and inference latency. DP and Chronos Policy, 2× playback.

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:28.100
Zoom back to the observation timing diagram.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:28.450
Continue on physical time.

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:31.850
Different sensor rates. Each sensor follows its own clock.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:33.150
Zoom into Pivoting.

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:43.983
Policy sensitive to sensor-rate changes. DP and Chronos Policy, 2× playback.

00:00:43.983 --> 00:00:45.233
Zoom back to the different sensor rates diagram.

00:00:45.233 --> 00:00:45.583
Continue on physical time.

00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:53.583
Chronos Policy: Learning Robot Policies on Physical Time. A equals f of O expands to include observation capture times and requested action times.
